  "description": "Test build of Ziggs as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Ziggs so Satchel Charge is thrown at a point - knocking enemies away from the blast, blasting Ziggs away when he is in it and blowing up an enemy tower below 30% health - when a champion dives him, a low tower is in reach or a wounded champion is just out of his reach; Bouncing Bomb bounces on along the throw; and Short Fuse's bomb deals x1.75 to towers. The main pack's data can push only away from the caster, cannot start a projectile at a landing point and cannot read a tower's health. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
